{:name "Forth Walls"
 :id "teraum-green-delta-game-bellybrush-forth-walls"
 :description "This is Wahl's Walls, a store in the town of Bellybrush that specializes in refurbishing the clay walls used frequently in older buildings around town. There's, of debatable irony, a large crack running through the southern wall."
 :exits {:south :okaga-cargo-bay-four}}
